      "summary": "A person recorded a 6 s demonstration video of a task for the robot arm.\nObjects in the scene: none recognised.\nActions, in order:\n- 0.0-6.5s: described the task [unknown]  (said \"Maybe we can make a video of like you doing this, essentially, with like a phone. That can be used.\")\nWhat they said: \"Maybe we can make a video of like you doing this, essentially, with like a phone. That can be used.\"\nWrite a skill that makes the robot arm reproduce this task: detect each object first, pick, place at the same destination, verify, then go home. Keep the same order. The arm's camera is on its head and it knows four objects: orange screw, blue bucket, green ring, white bucket lid; map what the person handled to the closest of these. Putting something in a cup/bucket/container means into the blue bucket; putting it to one side or on a pad means the delivery zone.",
